stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Available

    Available --> Reserved: reservation assigned
    Reserved --> Occupied: guest checked in
    Reserved --> Available: reservation cancelled/no-show
    Occupied --> Dirty: guest checked out
    Dirty --> Cleaning: task claimed
    Cleaning --> Inspected: cleaning completed
    Inspected --> Available: inspection passed
    Inspected --> Cleaning: inspection failed

    Available --> UnderMaintenance: maintenance issue/block
    Reserved --> UnderMaintenance: urgent maintenance block
    UnderMaintenance --> Available: maintenance completed

    state Available {
      [*] --> Clean
    }
    state Dirty {
      [*] --> NeedsCleaning
    }
